			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2376175">
									

<p>My not-so-secret shame is that I've always been a fan of AWCY?. That said, they aren't anything like the be-all-end-all anomalous art. They're not even the tip of the iceberg, they're the sprinkling of snow on top of said tip.</p>
<p>Good job on this writeup.</p>

