			<div class="content" id="post-content-2376284">
									

<p>A note:</p>
<p>Just because I feel that shit-anart is all AWCY can be doesn't mean that I feel that shit-anart is all that can be done on the site. Much the opposite.</p>
<p>But I want people to stretch those creative muscles and impress me. Make up new schools of anart, new movements, new styles.</p>
<p>Using AWCY turns into just a regurgitation of a meme in my eyes. Just slapping on a name, and that is very cheap and uncreative indeed. Why would there be only one anart school? We can have AWCY be the shitty murderous hipsters, and we can have other groups be other things.</p>

