			<div class="content" id="post-content-2376329">
									

<p>I feel like if we're going to pigeonhole GOI's just because some aspects of them are stuff we don't like, or some works related to them are stuff we don't like, we might as well do the same. Wondertainment pumps out cheap kid's toys that are anomalous and weird! How about the other toy-making groups?</p>
<p>The solution of AWCY being &quot;a regurgitation of a meme&quot; isn't to say &quot;let's continue to use this solely as a regurgitation of a meme&quot;, it's to write stuff in AWCY that is thought-provoking. This has happened numerous times, I feel, but it can still happen.</p>

